        {
          "text": "config.oauth is reserved for the trunk; adapters never read or write it, and publicConfig is an allow-list that keeps token ciphertext out of DTOs (CLAUDE.md:56)"
        },
        {
          "text": "a token refresh is a write on a read path: SELECT … FOR UPDATE on the connection row, and marking a connection expired commits in a separate transaction, or the marker rolls back with the error (CLAUDE.md:57)"
